      "para_index": 26,
      "domains": [
        "V"
      ],
      "modes": [
        "narrative"
      ],
      "reason": "「君餽之粟，則受之乎」問君餽之粟是否當受，論君臣之禮"
    },
    {
      "chapter": "wan-zhang-ii",
      "para_index": 27,
      "domains": [
        "V"
      ],
      "modes": [
        "proposition"
      ],
      "reason": "「君之於氓也，固周之」立君對氓當周恤之禮"
